  "description": "\"Show it to the camera.”\n\n“From next time on, Cha Seoyun, don’t put anything on either.\nBecause I want to see something even hotter.”\n“Then the chair might end up soaked while we’re in a meeting.”\n\nTeam Leader Jeong Jaejin of JS Asset Management’s Hong Kong branch fund management team—\nand the time I spend having thrilling video meetings with him twice a week.\nHow did things ever end up like this…?\n\nInside a video-call window I hadn’t managed to close,\nI came face-to-face with my boss, Jaejin, completely naked.\n\n“Look at those proportions. Is he, like, around 190 cm?”\n“Wow… his ass.”\n“…And.”\n\n“My god. They say the bigger the better, but that is *way* too big—even if it’s big!”\n“Are you sexually harassing me right now?”\n\nI’d been caught.\nJust as I was trembling with anxiety at the dizzying truth—that I’d teased someone so far above my pay grade—\n\n“If you’re sorry, then let me see, too.”\n“W-What… see what?”\n“What do you think. You. Naked.”\n\n“Please turn off the screen-recording function.”\n\nA fantasy-fulfillment romance with an unusually shared kink—two people of a feather finding each other.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11926770)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance-m/when-wfh-goes-wrong/list?title_no=8053), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/when-wfh-goes-wrong/list?title_no=8398)",
